Use this tool to read/control Nest thermostat state.

Required:
- `action`: one of `get_status`, `set_mode`, `set_target_temperature`, `set_eco_mode`, `set_fan_mode`

Conditional fields:
- `mode` for `set_mode` (`heat`, `cool`, `heat_cool`, `off`)
- `target_temperature` for `set_target_temperature` (single numeric temperature value)
- `enabled` for `set_eco_mode` (boolean)
- `fan_mode` for `set_fan_mode` (`on`, `auto`, `off`)

Optional:
- `device_id` to target a specific thermostat.
